WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.000
This is 99% Invisible. I'm Roman Mars. On the afternoon of June 18th in the Los Angeles neighborhood of Echo Park at the intersection of sunset boulevard and Logan Street, people were going about their day, having brunch at trendy cafes and perusing a local bookstore. When suddenly, they saw something extraordinary. A battle between good and evil. That's reporter and friend of the show, David Weinberg.
这里是“99%隐形”。我是罗曼·马尔斯。6月18日下午，在洛杉矶的回声公园社区，日落大道与洛根街的交汇处，人们正过着他们的日常生活，在时尚咖啡馆享用早午餐，在当地书店浏览书籍。突然，他们看到了非同寻常的一幕。一场正义与邪恶的较量。那是记者兼本节目之友大卫·温伯格。

